Eclipse Foundation.

This image ships:

- The official Keycloak 26.7.2 distribution (Apache-2.0)
  https://github.com/keycloak/keycloak
  Dist edits versus the official tarball: Windows launchers (.bat, .ps1)
  removed; `kc.sh build` run at image build with KC_DB=postgres,
  KC_HEALTH_ENABLED=true, KC_METRICS_ENABLED=true; runtime JRE replaced
  by a Temurin musl jlink image; apk package manager removed from the
  final layer.

- The Keycloak Operator quarkus-app from
  quay.io/keycloak/keycloak-operator:26.7.2 (Apache-2.0). UBI and
  Red Hat OpenJDK are not copied.
  https://github.com/keycloak/keycloak

- A jlink runtime derived from Eclipse Temurin (GPLv2 with Classpath
  Exception). The Temurin top-level NOTICE is copied to
  /licenses/temurin/; jlink keeps /opt/java/legal/.
  https://adoptium.net/

- Alpine Linux userland (BusyBox GPL-2.0-only, musl MIT, and other
  packages recorded in /licenses/alpine-packages.txt).
  https://alpinelinux.org/

- Fonts (DejaVu / FreeType / fontconfig) in the server image.

- JDBC drivers bundled unchanged in the official Keycloak dist:
  MySQL Connector/J (GPLv2 + Universal FOSS Exception),
  MariaDB Connector/J (LGPL-2.1-or-later),
  H2 (MPL-2.0 or EPL-1.0).

